  "description": "FI-08：错签指令。设备必须回 E1001 且不执行；注意这条断言的是'门没开'，不是'报错了'——错签被放行是安全事故。",
  "steps": [
    {"do": "link", "op": "connect"},
    {"do": "sendBadSign", "cmd": "OPEN_SLOT", "data": {"slotNo": 8}, "ttl": 30},
    {"do": "assert", "anyReplyCode": "E1001", "absentEvents": ["door_open"], "rejectedInboundAtLeast": 1},
    {"do": "log", "message": "E1001 已回且门未开"}
  ]
}
